  "description": "Tiny, fast, dependency-free PDF writer for .NET 10 and .NET MAUI 10 (Android/iOS). Subset-embedded TrueType fonts with full Unicode and kerning, Arabic shaping and the Unicode bidi algorithm for right-to-left text, kashida justification, separate Latin/Arabic fonts in one line, word wrap and flowing paragraphs, tables with page breaks, vector shapes, opacity and clipping, PNG and JPEG images (EXIF orientation), links and bookmarks. No reflection: trim- and AOT-safe.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
  "id": "NkkinPdf",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-11-03T10:28:00.613Z",
