  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 85102,
  "published": "2026-11-03T10:23:57.34Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.0.0 (breaking: .NET 10 only; DrawJpeg removed, use DrawImage)\n- Text: full Unicode bidi algorithm (implicit levels, paired brackets, LRM/RLM/ALM), pair kerning (GPOS/kern), invisible format characters and tabs no longer draw boxes, underline/strikethrough, Justify alignment with Arabic kashida, paragraph maxLines with ellipsis, PdfDocument.DrawParagraph flows across pages.\n- Graphics: dashed lines, ellipses, circles, polygons, PdfPath, clipping, opacity (PdfColor alpha, image opacity).\n- Images: JPEG EXIF orientation, opaque PNGs embedded without decoding, size guard for decoding.\n- Tables: per-cell styles (PdfCell), footer rows, vertical and outer borders, vertical alignment, rows taller than a page split across pages.\n- Document: bookmarks, internal links, Keywords, Language, RightToLeft, CreationDate (byte-identical output), smaller font subsets.\n- Faster: 2-14x less time and up to 75x fewer allocations; corrupt fonts/images throw InvalidDataException.",
